@startuml

title Product Domain Events

package "Product Events" {

    class ProductCreatedEvent <<DomainEvent>> {
        + ProductId : Guid
    }

    class ProductUpdatedEvent <<DomainEvent>> {
        + ProductId : Guid
    }

    class ProductDeletedEvent <<DomainEvent>> {
        + ProductId : Guid
    }
}

note right of ProductCreatedEvent
    Raised by: Product.Create(...)
    Handler: ProductCreatedEventHandler
      → OutboxEvent.Create("ProductCreated", payload)

    Payload:
    { "productId": "..." }

    Background Job:
      → Index 到 Elasticsearch
      → 清 Redis cache
end note

note right of ProductUpdatedEvent
    Raised by: product.Update(...)
    Handler: ProductUpdatedEventHandler
      → OutboxEvent.Create("ProductUpdated", payload)

    Payload:
    { "productId": "..." }

    Background Job:
      → Re-index 到 Elasticsearch
      → 清 Redis cache
end note

note right of ProductDeletedEvent
    Raised by: product.Delete()
    Handler: ProductDeletedEventHandler
      → OutboxEvent.Create("ProductDeleted", payload)

    Payload:
    { "productId": "..." }

    Background Job:
      → 從 Elasticsearch 刪除
      → 清 Redis cache
end note

@enduml
